# doom plays the demo of the shareware WAD file in /sys/games/lib/doom. The demo moves with time, so the script is a smoke test. The Esc key opens the menu, the Up key moves from the first item to the last item, which is Quit Game, and the Enter key selects it. The key y stops doom.
class smoke
window 660x440
run games/doom
pause 10
snap open
keys "\x1b"
pause 1
keys "\xef\x80\x8e"
pause 1
keys "\n"
pause 1
exit "y"
